MS-002`,isMandatory:!0,description:`CAPA Management SOP must be approved before creating CAPA records`,createdAt:`2024-01-15T08:00:00Z`},{id:`prereq-002`,organizationId:`org-001`,recordType:`NCR`,requiredDocType:`SOP`,requiredDocRef:`SOP-QMS-003`,isMandatory:!0,description:`Non-Conformance Management SOP must be approved before creating NCR records`,createdAt:`2024-01-15T08:00:00Z`},{id:`prereq-003`,organizationId:`org-001`,recordType:`AUDIT`,requiredDocType:`SOP`,requiredDocRef:`SOP-QMS-004`,isMandatory:!0,description:`Internal Audit Procedure must be approved before scheduling audits`,createdAt:`2024-01-15T08:00:00Z`},{id:`prereq-004`,organizationId:`org-001`,recordType:`CHANGE_CONTROL`,requiredDocType:`SOP`,isMandatory:!0,description:`Change Control SOP must be in place`,createdAt:`2024-01-15T08:00:00Z`},{id:`prereq-005`,organizationId:`org-001`,recordType:`DEVIATION`,requiredDocType:`SOP`,isMandatory:!1,description:`Deviation handling SOP recommended`,createdAt:`2024-01-15T08:00:00Z`}],uo=[{id:`cc-001`,ccNumber:`CC-2024-001`,title:`HEPA Filter Replacement - Grade A Cleanroom`,type:`Planned`,status:`In Implementation`,priority:`Critical`,category:`Equipment`,description:`Replacement of primary HEPA filter in Grade A cleanroom after degradation detected during environmental monitoring.`,justification:`HEPA filter degradation identified via environmental monitoring excursion. Filter has reached end of service life per manufacturer specifications.`,proposedChange:`Replace existing HEPA filter with new equivalent unit (Model: Camfil Megalam SP). Update PM schedule to reflect new filter life assessment.`,riskAssessment:`Risk of continued environmental excursions if filter not replaced. Installation will require temporary cleanroom shutdown - planned for weekend maintenance window.`,impactAnalysis:`Impact on production schedule minimal - planned during weekend downtime. No impact on product quality as cleanroom will be re-qualified before production resumes.`,implementationPlan:`1) Order replacement filter, 2) Schedule weekend installation, 3) Perform DQ/IQ/OQ, 4) Re-qualify cleanroom, 5) Update PM schedule`,implementationDate:`2024-04-20T08:00:00Z`,linkedCapaId:`capa-001`,linkedDocumentId:`doc-004`,assignedTo:`user-002`,requestedBy:`user-001`,approvedBy:`user-005`,dueDate:`2024-05-15T00:00:00Z`,createdById:`user-001`,organizationId:`org-001`,createdAt:`2024-03-20T08:00:00Z`,updatedAt:`2024-04-20T10:00:00Z`},{id:`cc-002`,ccNumber:`CC-2024-002`,title:`Label Template Update - Device Alpha`,type:`Planned`,status:`Completed`,priority:`High`,category:`Document`,description:`Update label template for Device Alpha to reflect new shelf-life of 24 months (previously 36 months).`,justification:`Stability data supports 24-month shelf life. Label template in printing system contained incorrect expiry date format.`,proposedChange:`Update label template in printing system. Modify barcode to include new expiry date format. Add verification step in label approval process.`,riskAssessment:`Low risk - change limited to labeling. Risk of using old templates mitigated by system lockout of obsolete templates.`,impactAnalysis:`No impact on product quality. Change affects only labeling. All future batches will use updated template.`,implementationPlan:`1) Update template in printing system, 2) Validate new template, 3) Obsolete old template, 4) Train labeling operators`,implementationDate:`2024-03-01T08:00:00Z`,completionDate:`2024-03-15T16:00:00Z`,linkedCapaId:`capa-005`,assignedTo:`user-004`,requestedBy:`user-001`,approvedBy:`user-002`,dueDate:`2024-03-31T00:00:00Z`,createdById:`user-001`,organizationId:`org-001`,createdAt:`2024-02-25T08:00:00Z`,updatedAt:`2024-03-15T16:00:00Z`},{id:`cc-003`,ccNumber:`CC-2024-003`,title:`Manufacturing Process Parameter Change - Mixing Speed`,type:`Planned`,status:`Under Review`,priority:`Medium`,category:`Process`,description:`Proposed change to mixing speed from 200 RPM to 220 RPM based on process optimization study.`,justification:`Process development study shows improved homogeneity at 220 RPM without affecting product quality attributes.`,proposedChange:`Increase mixing speed from 200 RPM to 220 RPM in manufacturing SOP and batch record template.`,riskAssessment:`Medium risk - requires re-validation of mixing step. Impact on downstream processing needs assessment.`,impactAnalysis:`May affect mixing time, temperature profile, and subsequent filling operations. Requires updated validation.`,assignedTo:`user-002`,requestedBy:`user-006`,dueDate:`2024-08-01T00:00:00Z`,createdById:`user-006`,organizationId:`org-001`,createdAt:`2024-05-01T08:00:00Z`,updatedAt:`2024-05-15T10:00:00Z`},{id:`cc-004`,ccNumber:`CC-2024-004`,title:`Emergency: HVAC System Bypass Protocol`,type:`Emergency`,status:`Approved`,priority:`Critical`,category:`Facility`,description:`Emergency change to implement HVAC bypass protocol during chiller replacement.`,justification:`Chiller unit failure requires immediate replacement. HVAC bypass needed to maintain partial cleanroom functionality during 48-hour replacement window.`,proposedChange:`Implement temporary HVAC bypass with enhanced environmental monitoring. Reduce cleanroom operations to essential activities only.`,riskAssessment:`High risk during bypass period. Enhanced monitoring and restricted operations mitigate risk to acceptable level.`,impactAnalysis:`Production limited to critical operations for 48 hours. All Grade B/C areas maintained. Grade A area restricted.`,implementationPlan:`1) Install temporary monitoring, 2) Activate bypass protocol, 3) Replace chiller, 4) Restore normal operations, 5) Re-qualify`,assignedTo:`user-001`,requestedBy:`user-001`,approvedBy:`user-005`,dueDate:`2024-05-20T00:00:00Z`,createdById:`user-001`,organizationId:`org-001`,createdAt:`2024-05-10T06:00:00Z`,updatedAt:`2024-05-10T12:00:00Z`}],fo=[{id:`dev-001`,devNumber:`DEV-2024-001`,title:`Temperature Excursion During Product Storage`,type:`Unplanned`,status:`Under Investigat